00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.590
Yeah, side profile, isn't it?

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.770
You didn't have a bowling
ball, though, so it's alright.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:36.950
Well let's see what would've happened

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:38.470
