00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.560
Oh, God, alright.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:40.393
You ready?

00:09:40.393 --> 00:09:42.933
Yep, here we go. 3, 2, 1, go.

00:09:46.539 --> 00:09:47.372
Eugh..

00:09:47.372 --> 00:09:50.540
Oh, man.

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.240
Yeah, gladly I didn't use
a bowling ball for that.

00:10:14.512 --> 00:10:16.440
It looks like Hunter worms.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.468
Hunter worms?

00:10:17.468 --> 00:10:19.339
Yeah, from- yeah.

00:10:19.339 --> 00:10:20.510
Oh, like go low.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.480
Yeah.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.750
It's like, it's a little bit JFK isn't it?

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.340
If anything, I would say it
does go a bit sort of back.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.862
Back, and to the left.

00:10:27.862 --> 00:10:29.552
And to the left, yeah.

00:10:29.552 --> 00:10:31.740
And to the left, yeah yeah.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:32.573
Definitely.

00:10:44.294 --> 00:10:45.860
Hold on to your chanus.

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:48.113
How about I just cover my
junk bellow just to be safe.

00:10:48.113 --> 00:10:50.070
You ready?
Yeah, let's go.

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:50.903
All right.

00:10:50.903 --> 00:10:52.483
Three, two, one, go.

00:10:56.314 --> 00:10:57.647
What?
My God.

00:10:59.098 --> 00:11:01.142
Where did the other--

00:11:01.142 --> 00:11:02.740
What happened there?

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.030
Wouldn't that be good in real bowling

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.360
