00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.627
Just--
Just push a button

00:11:06.627 --> 00:11:07.610
and I missed

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.350
So by the time your ball gets there,

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.550
there's only one pin up.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.084
Right in the middle.

00:12:10.084 --> 00:12:11.249
That is clean.

00:12:11.249 --> 00:12:12.082
That is clean.

00:12:12.082 --> 00:12:14.550
