more than any of the others.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:21.023
Oh man.

00:12:21.023 --> 00:12:22.183
There's just nothing left of it.

00:12:23.692 --> 00:12:24.525
I'm pretty proud of that.

00:12:24.525 --> 00:12:25.760
I think the Blue Men did a--

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.228
A damn good job of that.

00:12:27.228 --> 00:12:28.112
That's how you treat your spare.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:33.380
Well I thought that
was an excellent video.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.092
I even got a nice piece
of art to take home.

00:12:35.092 --> 00:12:35.925
I even got a nice piece of art.

